{"id":97248251299602,"type":"artist","name":"The Jayhawks","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":11,"info":{"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/The_Jayhawks_-_6013336426.jpg?width=500","bio":"The Jayhawks ha sido uno de los más genuinos grupos del estilo musical llamado Americana. La banda es originaria de Minesota y se hace popular en 1985. Entonces agrupaba a Marc Olson a la guitarra acústica y voces, Gary Louris a la guitarra eléctrica y voces, Marc Perlman al bajo y Thad Spencer a la batería. Ken Callahan sustituiría a Thad hasta 1993. En el 92, agotador año de conciertos, se les une Karen Grotberg para ocuparse de los teclados. En 1995 Olson deja la banda, que pasa a ser liderada por Lourys.","tags":["Alt-country","americana","rock","country","alt country"]},"works":[{"id":272567997608702,"type":"album","name":"Jayhawks","artist":"Jayhawks","year":1986,"weight":6,"yt":"jZJczZPnTo4","src":"books","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[],"n_lists":0}},{"id":180490454198188,"type":"album","name":"Blue Earth","artist":"The Jayhawks","year":1989,"weight":9,"yt":"VCD3BsovxVI","src":"books,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":215436743643591,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Roots Rock","rank":152,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":141370647995978,"type":"album","name":"Hollywood Town Hall","artist":"Jayhawks","year":1992,"weight":23,"yt":"OOvMcEWXsCo","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":55316938071026,"name":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 1992","rank":140,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":13018320481353,"name":"Scaruffi 1990s","rank":794,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":103254340346721,"name":"RYM Top — Regional Music — Americana","rank":32,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":109535037444116,"n